# Finder junk only. This repository serves ~20 separate projects, so nothing
# here may match real content - these four patterns match macOS droppings and
# nothing else.
#
# "Icon?" is not a typo. Finder's custom-folder-icon file is literally named
# "Icon" followed by a carriage return, and in gitignore "?" matches any single
# character. Without this line, `git add -A` commits one every time Finder
# looks at a folder - 17 of them had accumulated under mc/ by 2026-09-22.
.DS_Store
._*
Icon
Icon?
